# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vigilia Platform — Trivy CVE Ignore List
#
# Purpose: Document CVEs that have been consciously accepted.
#          Every entry MUST include a reason and a review date.
#          This file is auditable — do not add entries without team discussion.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-XXXXX  # reason | review date
#
# Policy:
#   CRITICAL → must be resolved before merge (no ignore allowed)
#   HIGH     → must be resolved within 1 sprint (can be ignored with justification)
#   MEDIUM   → tracked but does not block pipeline
#   LOW      → ignored by default (not in Trivy severity filter)
#
# Note: prefer fixing via Dependabot PR over ignoring here.
